      48.81,
      377.05,
      538.89,
      424.12
    ],
    "text": "BY VIRTUE of the powers vested in me by Section 11 of the National Thoroughfares Act, No. 40 of 2008, I, KabirHashim, Minister of Highways and Investment Promotion, do by this Order designate the National Highway which wasdesignated as an \u201cExpressway\u201d by Order published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1920/36 of June 26, 2015 andspecified in the Schedule to this Order to be an \u201cUser Fee National Highway\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.81,
      437.05,
      538.92,
      472.12
    ],
    "text": "The Order made under Section 11 of the aforesaid Act designating \u201cKottawa - Kothalawala Section of OuterCircular National Highway (from 0.000 km to 9.900 km)\u201d as an User Fee National Highway, and published in the GazetteExtraordinary No. 1850/33 of February 19, 2014 is hereby rescinded without prejudice to anything done thereunder.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
